<title>USA: West Coast Bancorp ups div to $$0.127/shr.</title>
<headline>West Coast Bancorp ups div to $$0.127/shr.</headline>
<dateline>CAPR CORAL, Fla. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $  0.127		  $  0.06</p>
<p> Pay		  Feb 17</p>
<p> Record	     Feb  7</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is West Coast Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>Div made pursuant to the terms of the definitive merger agreement with FNB Corp whereby West Coast is permitted to pay dividends equal to FNB Corp's dividend, which was $0.16/shr, and taking into consideration the 0.794 exchange ratio as set forth in the definitive merger agreement.</p>
</text>
